<description>&lt;p&gt;Armed clashes continue in Bangui as government forces, former Séléka rebels and Anti-balaka militias fight, with Russian Wagner forces and Africa Corps protecting President Touadéra. A large-scale militant attack was foiled, showing rebel capacity to plan major operations. Humanitarian aid deliveries are increasingly insecure, putting assistance at risk. France and Chad are meeting to rebuild defence ties, with President Macron and Mahamat Idriss Déby discussing cooperation that could affect regional security. The conflict caused 246 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxOV21leHdWY0ZJaTNsclFDN3BGUGlUaThaRFVIcVpqcWdMY0hYZ25rVmU4a05JVUFyblRNbUswTmZSbVhfcG0wYXhwLUd6UmJEUHVZc3BJblR6VHZpVGdKeUhNU0tabTRUR2h0VVBUS05PbmZMS1hNRTFPeV9wTl9XWHhvUWVHcVJUUjRkaVFac25xdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Sunday Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Modern Ghana&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxNR005aXpaajlTOUhuZTh0MTBIMHRNSk5rblgwOFZpUmxJMy04R2psWkZXU25ZU2tsR3JEeGNRMFN4bDY5V1BWaTI3M1V1cDF0ZkFCc2lKVldJdU1iZjg4dEZXN3N3SDdSTHJycWhZYnBKSHNuQTVwa3M1Yk9OWWtySlhoUE5HNzRfWmdBNUxpOTVkeWtVbGhGaFFMbW1TNGhHNlI1WHlnZ0ZmWDM0SGFya0VqbjY?oc=5&quot;&gt;Law.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;WKOW&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Court TV&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxQbWtaYnM3Q1I2cU1zSzR4c2hzZ1ItWWhkcU1vUFcyWkdoR1VuUXo2ZFFJeFNVc2tDXzZUZTlqMEJJQVdrbzFXRzZwbGp5SUtTVXBXMW1pRXF3amZHNkxlMVg1RWNzYVZ5Mk5DZEpRN1JLc1QtVUdZVk5uOFh5NFFaWlFZYWVSZ1pSY2hWWE1RSFc3c2pqS2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;beninwebtv.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;ht